          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تتمتع بعض الأجهزة بالقدرة المدمجة على مسح رموز الاستجابة السريعة تلقائيًا من المعرض. فيما يلي كيفية القيام بذلك على أجهزة Samsung التي تعمل بنظام One UI 3.0 أو الأحدث:"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some devices have the built-in ability to scan QR codes automatically from the gallery. Here’s how to do it on Samsung devices running One UI 3.0 or later:"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some devices have the built-in ability to scan QR codes automatically from the gallery. Here’s how to do it on Samsung devices running One UI 3.0 or later:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "userGuideView.androidGuideFourthStep" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يجب أن تظهر نافذة منبثقة في الجزء السفلي من الشاشة، مع زر مكتوب عليه «مسح رمز الاستجابة السريعة»."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A pop-up window should appear at the bottom of the screen, with a button that says “Scan QR code."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A pop-up window should appear at the bottom of the screen, with a button that says “Scan QR code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "userGuideView.androidGuideFourthTextTitle" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بعض أجهزة Samsung المعروفة بدعم هذه الميزة تتضمن ما يلي:"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some of the Samsung devices that are known to support this feature include:"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Some of the Samsung devices that are known to support this feature include:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "userGuideView.androidGuideSecondStep" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "انتقل إلى صورة رمز الاستجابة السريعة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Navigate to the image of the QR code."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Navigate to the image of the QR code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "userGuideView.androidGuideSecondText" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إن القدرة المضمنة على مسح رموز الاستجابة السريعة تلقائيًا من المعرض في أجهزة Samsung ميزة تم تقديمها مع One UI 3.0، إذ تستند إلى Android 11. وتتوفر هذه الميزة في أجهزة Samsung التي تعمل بنظام One UI 3.0 أو إصدار أحدث."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The built-in ability to scan QR codes automatically from the gallery on Samsung devices is a feature that was introduced with One UI 3.0, which is based on Android 11. This feature is available on Samsung devices that are running One UI 3.0 or later."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The built-in ability to scan QR codes automatically from the gallery on Samsung devices is a feature that was introduced with One UI 3.0, which is based on Android 11. This feature is available on Samsung devices that are running One UI 3.0 or later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "userGuideView.androidGuideSixthStep" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اتبع التعليمات لتثبيت eSIM وتنشيطها في جهازك."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Follow the prompts to install the eSIM and activate it for your device."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Follow the prompts to install the eSIM and activate it for your device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "userGuideView.androidGuideThirdStep" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "اضغط على الصورة لفتحها."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap on the image to open it."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap on the image to open it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "userGuideView.androidGuideThirdText" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ومع ذلك، قد يعتمد توفر الميزة أيضًا على الطراز المحدد والمتغير للجهاز. على سبيل المثال، ربما لم تتلق بعض الطرازات القديمة تحديث One UI 3.0، وبالتالي لن تحتوي على الميزة."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "However, availability of the feature may also depend on the specific model and variant of the device. For example, some older models may not have received the One UI 3.0 update, and therefore would not have the feature."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "However, availability of the feature may also depend on the specific model and variant of the device. For example, some older models may not have received the One UI 3.0 update, and therefore would not have the feature."
          }
        }
      }
    },
